{"kind": "mod", "id": 1157, "name": "HK416 16\"in (406mm) Heavy Barrel", "slug": "hk416-16in-406mm-heavy-barrel", "teaser": "Old school days.", "owner_name": "NORVINSK_EVANGELION", "downloads": 8041, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": null, "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:02:03.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-11-12T12:40:15.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-11-12T12:40:15.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.10.0", "latest_version": "1.1.4", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": null, "description_html": "<p>Big thanks to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/33069-moxopixel/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MoxoPixel</a>’s tutorial that improves the textures to be more realistic.</p>\n<p>-&gt;<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/doc/entry/84-import-bundles-into-unity-spt-sdk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Import Bundles Into Unity SPT SDK</a></p>\n<p>Thanks to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/20801-sheepy/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">sheepy</a> , Realism Compatible Patch: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1998-hk416-16in-heavy-barrel-realism-compatibility/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">HK416 16in Heavy Barrel Realism Compatibility</a></p>\n<p>Due to bsg’s poor tech, there’s lots of interventions in weapon building, as for HK416A5, if you want to use a long handguard, then you can only use 20in barrel.</p>\n<p>In fact, if you fold the sight of the barrel and it works with these blocking handguards.</p>\n<p>So, here’s a simple mod that uses 16in heavy barrel, a chunky one, allows you to install all the handguards.</p>\n<p>Access in ragfair only.</p>\n<p>Compared to 16.5in barrel, recoil-, heat-, quality+, ergo+, while cooling+, accuracy-, weight+, velocity-</p>\n<p>but equally the same</p>\n<p>(In fact, the heavy barrel performs better because of the compatibility of long handguards)</p>\n<p>I don’t want 20in barrel in HK416.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.1.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.8.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1104, "published_at": "2024-04-10T11:02:24.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1157/hk416-16in-406mm-heavy-barrel/1.1.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 2171, "published_at": "2024-07-18T11:02:44.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1157/hk416-16in-406mm-heavy-barrel/1.1.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.4", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1175, "published_at": "2025-02-14T17:01:19.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1157/hk416-16in-406mm-heavy-barrel/1.1.4", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "source_code_links": []}